  "description": "Two bed furnished apartment to rent in picturesque location at the foot of the Wicklow hills, close to the villages of Hollywood, Ballymore Eustace and Dunlavin. Blessington 15mins, Naas 25 mins, Dublin 1hr. I km to express bus stop for 132. \nLocated in a rural setting , accessed by a quiet lane way and adjacent to owners home. Own transport essential. \nPrivate parking with use of a garden area. \nNo pets allowed. \nWell equipped kitchen with Gas hob, electric oven , microwave , fridge freezer , good storage, cutlery, crockery etc., \nSeparate utility area with washing machine and dryer. \nTwo modern bedrooms with ample storage space. \nSeperate office area. \nTwo bathrooms one on each floor. \nOil fired central heating with individual electric meter. \nReferences and deposit required. \nShort bio to email if interested. \n\n",
